- SAFE: Security risk.
- CAPACITY: Capacity risk.', example='SYSTEM'),
      situation?: string(name='situation', description='The current risk situation of the instance in JSON string format.', example='{"desc":"The cluster has only one node and does not support high availability."}'),
      suggestion?: string(name='suggestion', description='The optimization suggestions for the risk in JSON string format, including descriptions and action links.', example='{"desc":"Scale out to two or more nodes.","links":[{"descEn":"click to upgrade specification","type":"upgrade","desc":"Click to scale out"}]}'),
    }
